d a custom visualisation with SolaraViz ([examples#157](https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa-examples/pull/157) by @zjost). The first example using the `PropertyLayer` was added, a very fast implementation of Conway's Game of Life ([examples#182](https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa-examples/pull/182)).\n./HISTORY.md:288:* SolaraViz: Reset components when params are changed by @rht in https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/pull/2240\n./HISTORY.md:336:Mesa 3.0 alpha 1 (`v3.0.0a1`) is another step towards our next major version. This release introduces a name change from JupyterViz (jupyter_viz) to SolaraViz (solara_viz), to better represent the tech stack being used. It also includes two bugfixes also present in 2.3.2.\n./HISTORY.md:342:* Rename JupyterViz to SolaraViz by @rht in https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/pull/2187\n./mesa/examples/basic/virus_on_network/app.py:12:    SolaraViz,\n./mesa/examples/basic/virus_on_network/app.py:104:page = SolaraViz(\n./mesa/examples/basic/schelling/app.py:6:    SolaraViz,\n./mesa/examples/basic/schelling/app.py:33:page = SolaraViz(\n./mesa/examples/basic/conways_game_of_life/app.py:3:    SolaraViz,\n./mesa/examples/basic/conways_game_of_life/app.py:40:# Create the SolaraViz page. This will automatically create a server and display the\n./mesa/examples/basic/conways_game_of_life/app.py:45:page = SolaraViz(\n./mesa/examples/basic/boltzmann_wealth_model/app.py:3:    SolaraViz,\n./mesa/examples/basic/boltzmann_wealth_model/app.py:51:# Create the SolaraViz page. This will automatically create a server and display the\n./mesa/examples/basic/boltzmann_wealth_model/app.py:56:page = SolaraViz(\n./mesa/examples/basic/boid_flockers/app.py:2:from mesa.visualization import Slider, SolaraViz, make_space_component\n./mesa/examples/basic/boid_flockers/app.py:52:page = SolaraViz(\n./mesa/examples/advanced/wolf_sheep/app.py:5:    SolaraViz,\n./mesa/examples/advanced/wolf_sheep/app.py:78:page = SolaraViz(\n./mesa/examples/advanced/sugarscape_g1mt/app