{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented support for `**kwargs` constructors and removed the conditional-hook warnings in Solara visualization.\n\n- Constructor validation now ignores the `kwargs` parameter itself and permits extra keyword arguments when `**kwargs` exists (`mesa/visualization/solara_viz.py:331`).\n- Startup validation checks the combined fixed and user-configured parameters (`mesa/visualization/solara_viz.py:314`).\n- Reactive fallbacks are now created unconditionally, eliminating the conditional-hook warning while preserving hook order (`mesa/visualization/solara_viz.py:193`).\n- Added regression coverage for required parameters plus `**kwargs` (`tests/test_solara_viz.py:208`).\n- Validation passes: 249 tests passed, 1 skipped; Ruff check and formatting are clean."}}
